 138:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/XMC/XMC4200/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_ccu8.h ****  * The CCU8 peripheral functions play a major role in applications that need complex Pulse Width Mo
 139:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/XMC/XMC4200/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_ccu8.h ****  * generation, with complementary high side and low side switches, multi phase control. These funct
 140:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/XMC/XMC4200/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_ccu8.h ****  * with a very flexible and programmable signal conditioning scheme, make the CCU8 the must have pe
 141:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/XMC/XMC4200/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_ccu8.h ****  * of the art motor control, multi phase and multi level power electronics systems.\n
 142:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/XMC/XMC4200/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_ccu8.h ****  * Each CCU8 module is comprised of four identical 16 bit Capture/Compare Timer slices, CC8y (where
 143:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/XMC/XMC4200/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_ccu8.h ****  * timer slice can work in compare mode or in capture mode.
 144:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/XMC/XMC4200/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_ccu8.h ****  *
 145:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/XMC/XMC4200/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_ccu8.h ****  * APIs provided in this file cover the following functional blocks of CCU8:
