 148:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/XMC/XMC4200/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_ccu8.h ****  * 1. SLICE (APIs prefixed with e.g. XMC_CCU8_SLICE_)
 149:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/XMC/XMC4200/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_ccu8.h ****  * 2. Module (APIs are not having any prefix e.g. XMC_CCU8_)
