 153:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/XMC/XMC4200/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_ccu8.h ****  * XMC_CCU8_SLICE_DEAD_TIME_CONFIG_t and the initialization functions XMC_CCU8_SLICE_CompareInit(),
