2200:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/XMC/XMC4200/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_ccu8.h ****  * Programs the timer period, by writing CC8yPRS register.\n\n
2201:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/XMC/XMC4200/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_ccu8.h ****  * The frequency of counting/ PWM frequency is determined by this value. The period value is writte
2202:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/XMC/XMC4200/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_ccu8.h ****  * register. Explicitly enable the shadow transfer for the the period value by calling
2203:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/XMC/XMC4200/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_ccu8.h ****  * XMC_CCU8_EnableShadowTransfer() with appropriate mask. If shadow transfer is enabled and the tim
2204:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/XMC/XMC4200/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_ccu8.h ****  * a period match transfers the value from the shadow register to the actual period register.
