2243:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/XMC/XMC4200/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_ccu8.h ****  * Programs the timer compare value, by writing CC8yCR1S and CC8yCR2S registers.\n\n
2244:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/XMC/XMC4200/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_ccu8.h ****  *  The PWM duty cycle is determined by this value.\n\n
2245:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/XMC/XMC4200/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_ccu8.h ****  * The compare value is written to a shadow register. Explicitly enable the shadow transfer for
2246:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/XMC/XMC4200/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_ccu8.h ****  * the the period/compare value by calling XMC_CCU8_EnableShadowTransfer() with
2247:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/XMC/XMC4200/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_ccu8.h ****  * appropriate mask.If shadow transfer is enabled and the timer is running,
2248:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/XMC/XMC4200/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_ccu8.h ****  * a period match transfers the value from the shadow register to the actual compare register.
2249:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/XMC/XMC4200/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_ccu8.h ****  *
