2438:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/XMC/XMC4200/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_ccu8.h ****  * The \b spread would provide the dither compare value. If the dither counter value is less than t
2439:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/XMC/XMC4200/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_ccu8.h ****  * the period/compare values would be dithered according to the dither mode selected. This API woul
