2516:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/XMC/XMC4200/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_ccu8.h ****  *                 Range: [0x0 to 0xF]
2517:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/XMC/XMC4200/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_ccu8.h ****  * @return <BR>
