2521:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/XMC/XMC4200/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_ccu8.h ****  * Sets the dither spread/compare value, by setting CC8yDITS.DCVS bits.\n\n
2522:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/XMC/XMC4200/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_ccu8.h ****  * This value is the cornerstone of PWM dithering feature. Dithering is applied/done when the value
2523:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/XMC/XMC4200/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_ccu8.h ****  * dithering counter is less than this compare/spread value. For all dithering counter values great
2524:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/XMC/XMC4200/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_ccu8.h ****  * the spread value, there is no dithering. After setting the value XMC_CCU8_EnableShadowTransfer()
2525:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/XMC/XMC4200/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_ccu8.h ****  * called with appropriate mask.
